  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"title\">\n    <h1 id=\"title\">Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" class=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">-1</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+1</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --btn-bg: #0f3460;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #000;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 360px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 4px solid var(--btn-bg);\n  padding: 8px 0;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  min-height: 1.2em;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 8px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--text);\n  background: var(--btn-bg);\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  min-width: 64px;\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;\n  box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #000;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(3px, 3px);\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  .count {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n  }\n  button {\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "let count = 0;\n\nconst countEl = document.getElementById('count');\nconst increaseBtn = document.getElementById('increase');\nconst decreaseBtn = document.getElementById('decrease');\nconst resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');\n\nfunction render() {\n  countEl.textContent = count;\n}\n\nincreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count += 1;\n  render();\n});\n\ndecreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count -= 1;\n  render();\n});\n\nresetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count = 0;\n  render();\n});\n\nrender();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA dependency-free, offline pixel-style counter built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.\n\n## Features\n\n- Initial value: 0\n- Increase (+1), decrease (-1), and reset to zero\n- Supports negative numbers\n- Keyboard-accessible labeled buttons\n- No imports, packages, network requests, storage, or external assets\n- Responsive layout down to 360px wide\n\n## Controls\n\n| Button ID | Action |\n|-----------|--------|\n| `increase` | Adds 1 to the count |\n| `decrease` | Subtracts 1 from the count |\n| `reset` | Sets the count back to 0 |\n\nThe current integer is displayed in the `<output>` element with ID `count`.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Click the buttons or use Tab to focus them and press Enter/Space.\n\nNo server or internet connection is required.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and structure\n- `styles.css` — pixel-themed styling\n- `script.js` — counter logic\n\n## Line Count\n\nTotal source lines: under 200.",
      "description": ""
    }
